<%#
Cistergraphia: Transcription (fol. 3r)
======================================

Purpose:
- Show the decoded message as a transcription, with a plain Cistercian initial
- A worn plate's text is an edition (Leiden conventions): restorations
  in rubric, doubts the balance cannot settle dotted, for the reader to choose
- A broken plate is read once rejoined: the one arrangement whose pairs all balance
%>
<section class="leaf leaf--narrow" aria-labelledby="transcription-title">
  <p class="folio-mark" aria-hidden="true">fol. 3<sup>r</sup></p>
  <h1 id="transcription-title" class="rubric">Transcription</h1>
  <p class="lede"><% if @broken && @weathered %>Rejoined from a ruined plate: of every way its fragments fit the board, turned or not, one lets every pair balance. Then restored, in the epigraphers’ notation: [r] the pair balances only one way; [b/l] it balances both ways, and the words decide.<% elsif @broken %>Rejoined from a broken plate: of every way its fragments fit the board, turned or not, one balances every pair.<% elsif @weathered %>Restored from a worn plate, in the epigraphers’ notation: [r] the pair balances only one way; [b/l] it balances both ways, and the words decide.<% else %><%= @secret ? 'Unsealed with its passphrase: authentic and unaltered.' : 'Read from an open plate: letters and spaces, as enciphered.' %><% end %>
    <% if @reader == :abbot %>Read with the abbot’s key: the novice’s message follows.<% elsif @reader == :novice %>Read with the novice’s key.<% end %></p>

  <p class="transcription" data-transcription><% if @weathered %><%== leiden_html(@message) %><% else %><%= @message %><% end %></p>
  <% if @decoy %>
    <h2 class="index-heading">The novice’s grille reads</h2>
    <p class="transcription transcription--second"><%= @decoy %></p>
  <% end %>

  <div class="actions">
    <button type="button" class="btn" data-action="copy-text">Copy text</button>
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/decode">Read another</a>
    <a class="btn btn--quiet" href="/">Inscribe a message</a>
  </div>
</section>
